recommend keep-going Tenure r1 (the crux) stands; next agent-doable is r2 (the verdict travels as a format tenure-v1 Bron record, round-tripped byte-for-byte, same holder_of), then r3 (across a Knot) and r4 (a real contested fixture cross-checked by awk). Breach renames (cairn-first), deep debride + seed force-push, and quorum-served readings stay Keaton's hand.
